 is the new industry standard. Every competitor reports BEAM scores. Scaling behavior is where graph memory should differentiate from flat vector stores."}]}],"id":"blk-71111","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-71113","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-103954","text":"Session 2: MemoryAgentBench"}]},{"id":"blk-71114","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71116","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-103955","marks":["bold"],"text":"Goal ID"},{"id":"spn-103956","text":": "},{"id":"spn-103957","marks":["code"],"text":"goal_8889e094cb2b904d65f6a29cd7861f1c"}]}],"id":"blk-71115","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71118","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-103958","marks":["bold"],"text":"Paper"},{"id":"spn-103959","text":": https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.05257"}]}],"id":"blk-71117","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71120","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-103960","marks":["bold"],"text":"Repo"},{"id":"spn-103961","text":": https://github.com/HUST-AI-HYZ/MemoryAgentBench"}]}],"id":"blk-71119","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71122","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-103962","marks":["bold"],"text":"Dataset"},{"id":"spn-103963","text":": Multi-turn incremental format, includes EventQA and FactConsolidation"}]}],"id":"blk-71121","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71124","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-103964","marks":["bold"],"text":"Metrics"},{"id":"spn-103965","text":": 4 competency scores — accurate retrieval, test-time learning, long-range understanding, selective forgetting"}]}],"id":"blk-71123","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71126","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-103966","marks":["bold"],"text":"Key challenge"},{"id":"spn-103967","text":": Multi-turn format requires simulating incremental store→query cycles, not batch ingest. Map \"selective forgetting\" to "},{"id":"spn-103968","marks":["code"],"text":"forget_by_policy"},{"id":"spn-103969","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-103970